// A `chords NAME` row directly above a `tab` staff: the chord part's symbols
// stand above the tablature, exactly like the notation-staff form.
// Here the guitar tab carries the fingering while the harmony row prints C / F
// above it.
octave absolute
time 4/4
key c major
part melody { clef treble_8 tuning guitar section A { c'4 e' g' e' | f' a' c'' a' | } }
chords harmony { section A { C | F | } }
form main { A }
score main {
  chords harmony
  tab melody
}
